    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d662-a1-a3">

                <pb facs="0843" n="761" xml:id="pg761"/>

                <head>Mr. Chase to Commandant
                        Givertoss</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consulate General of the United
                                States</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 25, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> In reply to your note of the present date,
                    I have the honor to state to you that the only persons I am aware of who have
                    arrived in this city are those that came in on yesterday, viz: Charles E.
                    Johnson, William Garret, and Lewis Davison, seamen, and five passengers—the
                    names of the latter I have not as yet ascertained—all of whom are from the <pb
                        facs="0844" n="762" xml:id="pg762"/> American schooner E. D. McClenahan, G.
                    R. Edgett, master, which vessel was lately wrecked near Soto la Marina on her
                    passage from New Orleans for this port.</p>
                <p>These persons are doubtless peaceable; but if I should hear of anything to the
                    contrary, they will not receive any countenance or protection from this
                    consulate.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, most respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FBANKLIN CHASE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Superior Commandant</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">of this place, &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
